{"id":1827190,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-16T21:08:39.464Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5GEEQYfGFJTRCr0Vflj5dmXaCgn.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"}],"homepage":"https://www.freshwave.hk/?a=doc&id=1495","id":1827190,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["HK"],"original_language":"cn","original_title":"誰聽赤子心","overview":"Becoming an adult could be simply tiring for many. 17-year-old Long suffers a heavy blow by his best friend Hung’s incomprehensible suicide. Long cannot reconcile to his friend's decision, yet school life goes on. Putting together the fragments of overlooked bygone events, the truth of Hung’s suicide gradually surfaces. After a glimpse of the sorrow and desperation from which his best friend has been suffering, what course should Long take? Perched on the edge between life and death, how will he survive in the cruel world? Hopefully, someone will hear the silent cries of the young and wounded.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/ypmh2DJuYgJUVfrWRj7y9szzHrl.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":61392,"logo_path":"/e1g54NyBA3ICLice0kKOYHMc84u.png","name":"Fresh Wave","origin_country":"HK"},{"id":61393,"logo_path":"/zBPeWCDSwQ2PDSRHacdt4HPHw3n.png","name":"Hong Kong Arts Development Council","origin_country":"HK"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"Hong Kong"}],"release_date":"2018-04-10","revenue":0,"runtime":25,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Cantonese","iso_639_1":"cn","name":"广州话 / 廣州話"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Silent Sky","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":236071,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Howard Sit Lap-yin","original_name":"薛立賢","popularity":0.3946,"profile_path":"/j3VegG7Sw2YdzNBALg8FEz96pLS.jpg","cast_id":5,"character":"Long","credit_id":"6afab7aef489bc3b426e380e","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":6173795,"known_for_department"